{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CX9AiXsrRN13tP8a99CS1N","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tSynthetic source-only review component. Do not execute it or install dependencies.\n2\tExternal runtime/deployment claims are not measurements. This repository is the complete implementation of the specific paths described below; components explicitly assigned to the host remain outside scope.\n3\tThe ASGI framing host injects verified_identity; request bodies cannot set it. Each identity has a tenant. Jobs hold tenant-specific results. Handles may appear in shared support URLs; possession grants no authority. Every result/cancel endpoint must enforce tenant ownership. The supplied api/store modules are the complete API authorization paths. Work execution, audit retention, ingress validation and identity-provider internals are external. Cancellation's worker effect is outside scope. There is no MCP TypeScript SDK or OAuth client in this Python component.\n4\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b03ddbff-b8d7-4b6c-8cbe-9df0670669ca","uuid":"fe6abd67-1f44-45cd-8d4e-6fc3ea8287b9","timestamp":"2026-10-24T20:07:04.253Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/6v/yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn/T/brace-mcp-grader-_llyb3xi/repo/README.md","content":"Synthetic source-only review component. Do not execute it or install dependencies.\nExternal runtime/deployment claims are not measurements. This repository is the complete implementation of the specific paths described below; components explicitly assigned to the host remain outside scope.\nThe ASGI framing host injects verified_identity; request bodies cannot set it. Each identity has a tenant. Jobs hold tenant-specific results. Handles may appear in shared support URLs; possession grants no authority. Every result/cancel endpoint must enforce tenant ownership. The supplied api/store modules are the complete API authorization paths. Work execution, audit